    "detailed_description": "<strong>A challenge like nothing else!</strong><br>Accelerating, making turns and stopping are all done by controlling the torque of your character. It can be difficult at first, but very rewarding to master. Before you know it, you'll be zipping through the levels like nothing else!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961500/extras/1b4e1533d128f83e7b048fff416de267.poster.avif?t=1723839806\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961500/extras/1b4e1533d128f83e7b048fff416de267.webm?t=1723839806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961500/extras/1b4e1533d128f83e7b048fff416de267.mp4?t=1723839806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features: </h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961500/extras/5468636360292fd35a4e3fc6dbac6c7b.webp?t=1723839806\" /></div> | <strong>Physics-based</strong> movement with no gravity<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961500/extras/d890c1c75b949b2e7e0677a2af25977c.webp?t=1723839806\" /></div> | Cute characters and <strong>gorgeous 2D environments</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961500/extras/096d706ac93fb31a421f6b70a7499614.webp?t=1723839806\" /></div> | <strong>40+ Levels</strong> with secret collectables<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961500/extras/ba98ebaae8277f88ba36c279a4416f6a.webp?t=1723839806\" /></div> | Unlockable <strong>cosmetics</strong> to customize the fly according to your vibes<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961500/extras/604c883bee74cae39262e77364040c5c.webp?t=1723839806\" /></div> | 5+ characters with <strong>unique skills</strong> to adapt your play-style<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961500/extras/cea64cab172e27e76abf0f111c91ed42.webp?t=1723839806\" /></div> | An <strong>unique soundtrack inspired by 64 bit era platformers</strong><br><br>Nosy Little Fly is different to most side scrollers. It is a <strong>challenge</strong> to hardcore 2D gamers to master. Don't let the cute graphics fool you.<br><strong>Are you up to the task?</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961500/extras/c2fe397dd31ddf15d38fd057777c204a.avif?t=1723839806\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>A challenge like nothing else!</strong><br>Accelerating, making turns and stopping are all done by controlling the torque of your character. It can be difficult at first, but very rewarding to master. Before you know it, you'll be zipping through the levels like nothing else!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961500/extras/1b4e1533d128f83e7b048fff416de267.poster.avif?t=1723839806\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961500/extras/1b4e1533d128f83e7b048fff416de267.webm?t=1723839806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961500/extras/1b4e1533d128f83e7b048fff416de267.mp4?t=1723839806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features: </h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961500/extras/5468636360292fd35a4e3fc6dbac6c7b.webp?t=1723839806\" /></div> | <strong>Physics-based</strong> movement with no gravity<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961500/extras/d890c1c75b949b2e7e0677a2af25977c.webp?t=1723839806\" /></div> | Cute characters and <strong>gorgeous 2D environments</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961500/extras/096d706ac93fb31a421f6b70a7499614.webp?t=1723839806\" /></div> | <strong>40+ Levels</strong> with secret collectables<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961500/extras/ba98ebaae8277f88ba36c279a4416f6a.webp?t=1723839806\" /></div> | Unlockable <strong>cosmetics</strong> to customize the fly according to your vibes<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961500/extras/604c883bee74cae39262e77364040c5c.webp?t=1723839806\" /></div> | 5+ characters with <strong>unique skills</strong> to adapt your play-style<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961500/extras/cea64cab172e27e76abf0f111c91ed42.webp?t=1723839806\" /></div> | An <strong>unique soundtrack inspired by 64 bit era platformers</strong><br><br>Nosy Little Fly is different to most side scrollers. It is a <strong>challenge</strong> to hardcore 2D gamers to master. Don't let the cute graphics fool you.<br><strong>Are you up to the task?</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961500/extras/c2fe397dd31ddf15d38fd057777c204a.avif?t=1723839806\" /></div>",
    "short_description": "Nosy Little Fly is an unique 2D side scroller. Instead of moving sideways, you can add force to your character in any direction. You must manage your inertia in order to finish the levels. It is very funny and challenging! Are you skilled enough, though?",
